00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:29,210
clinic site and it is not sold in the store. Do you have any credible information indicating

00:00:29,210 --> 00:00:35,410
chlorine dioxide even in small amounts as a cancer reducer? The substance usually contains

00:00:35,410 --> 00:00:44,570
sodium chloride, so wouldn't it be poisonous even in low concentrations? Could a curative

00:00:44,570 --> 00:01:05,450
claim be snakeling? Chlorine dioxide has also been sold as MMS, miracle, mineral solution. When

